{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ca8a5d4a089bcd6ec92c8d6aee9f690246d51cb9d7ff4b3d0f1223c39c57c114", "ja": "（このみさんの新しい衣装が完成した。\nさっそく試着してもらっているけど、どうかな……？）", "zh": "（这个美小姐的新服装完成了。\n现在正让她试穿，不知道效果怎么样……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "58437fd4e5ad8c359cad35291dea60bd3f60f5d084d5123c80a451ad3df9c7d0", "ja": "{$P$}、どうかしら？\n意見を聞かせてちょうだい。", "zh": "{$P$}，您觉得怎么样？\n请告诉我您的意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5dab4947d65c47365609a50dcc77b4c7fa0f8f6aea02caeffb5f492b67ea8458", "ja": "はい、最高です！　ピシッとしてて、カッコよくて……\n……って、これじゃ意見じゃなくて感想か。", "zh": "是的，太棒了！整整齐齐的，又帅气……\n……等等，这不算意见，应该算感想吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "6d477d73f502cd474683266baf204fdb8c8a8f927ae32174435154225b59fa8d", "ja": "フフッ♪　ありがと、自信がついたわ。\nホント、素敵な衣装よね。頼りになる艦長って感じで。", "zh": "呵呵♪谢谢，我更有自信了。\n真是件很棒的服装呢。感觉就像一位可靠的舰长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "e6a60ab4af909a24813d541f3ee7c3d4840fb3654ad07539e658b6124c446f27", "ja": "「この先に、どんな困難や危険が待っていても大丈夫。\nこの私に任せなさい！」……なんてね♪", "zh": "“前路无论有着怎样的困难与危险都不用怕。\n尽管交给我吧！”……开玩笑的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cad0e25b32b3aac3a1f8e1ad86ff6c396bef89b228e048bf1435c697477bbb37", "ja": "おっ、もう役作りもカンペキですね！", "zh": "哦，已经完全进入角色了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "ab64a24d94dace234c2219d685b4cd9746800f4035b669cfc4a6be5387b93c24", "ja": "当然よ♪　アダルティの銀河を冒険中の身としては、\nのんびりしているヒマはないもの。", "zh": "那是当然♪毕竟我正身处成熟的银河中冒险，\n可没有闲情逸致慢悠悠的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1007_p", "source_sha256": "83f4cb773421b8f9324820f2027ef0182c38d85f3ffcec81fff358e309552d29", "ja": "アダルティの銀河を……なるほど。", "zh": "“成人风格的银河”……原来如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "f5395c5812507901bc2f39c39282c4122cdf1e0fcc2bc660f62b2b108b764f76", "ja": "この衣装を着ていると、アイドル活動の全部が、\nまるで冒険みたいって思えてくるのよね。", "zh": "穿着这身服装，就会觉得偶像活动的全部经历，\n简直就像冒险一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "d0196ff7cd15a74dface5b55d17140ae4ef77cd33ae552b5ed0dd8a37b5d7490", "ja": "これから、どんな未知のステージやお仕事と出会えるの\nかしら、って……とってもワクワクしてくるわ。", "zh": "接下来会遇见怎样未知的舞台和工作呢……一想到这些，就让人无比期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1010_p", "source_sha256": "82fc77bc8163b47d0dd6fb2f0c0c4a927f699bba40e93fee9ae039c2d7a0614c", "ja": "確かに……アイドル業界は広い意味で、\n冒険に似たところはあるのかもしれませんね。", "zh": "确实……偶像行业从广义上来说，\n或许真的有几分像冒险呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "d4f00f7f2bc1e1bdeb6e0750775768e53eb3077d46cd9d0aecbdaf373894238f", "ja": "だとしたら{$P$}は……\n地図とかコンパスとか、そういう役目かしら？　フフ♪", "zh": "那么，{$P$}就是……负责地图或指南针之类的角色吗？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c60bbd2d1dd8ca95045f37e3f0c77cc6b2fbbc408ebda8c2ad3118b942d40862", "ja": "まあ、役目としてはそうなりますね。\n頼りにしてもらえるように、頑張ります。", "zh": "真要说职责的话，确实是那样呢。\n为了能让您依靠，我会努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "cb97ca4ec44d7044db0de2fd37246271cb99da6e28f6ecd1eeab9b499833f5b4", "ja": "ううん、今でも十分頼もしいわ。\nいつも私を導いてくれて、ありがとう。", "zh": "不，你现在就已经十分可靠了。\n一直以来指引着我前行，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "ab43e92005ac13d773761b315391288688dcecd81871b0e57d0e98ed057107ef", "ja": "そして……ねぇ、{$P$}。\nこれからも、私の冒険に付き合ってくれる？", "zh": "然后……那个，{$P$}。\n今后也愿意陪我一起冒险吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6f6c9eff38b9cce6038c91a22c1e2aeb1dbe18aaa52fef535d5e5c0a48870a21", "ja": "そんなことは……", "zh": "没那回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_1016", "source_sha256": "a70776f21662e5c08d45405a828a38d62c81e7ea67ef9984e6eb214aaef0740c", "ja": "当然です！", "zh": "那是当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_2000_p", "source_sha256": "359c94070967552d76a5cb489e34d888ce531d9b7580e88cd2a9df42ddfa504b", "ja": "当たり前じゃないですか、水くさいですよ。\nこのみさんの冒険が続く限り、ずっと付き合います。", "zh": "这是理所当然的嘛，太见外了。\n只要木实小姐的冒险还在继续，我就会一直奉陪到底。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_2001_039kon", "source_sha256": "57d90bdc3117db8f164e5bcc4f35776f24e2a2e7398a2ab5c009af5884980bde", "ja": "あら……ウフフ♪　それってちょっと……。\nっとと、なんでもないわ。", "zh": "哎呀……呵呵♪　这听起来有点……\n哎呀呀，没什么啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_2002_p", "source_sha256": "1287ac69ac3dea31761eb43e86c92209bf5c4515a4c1695dab9a08c59f95c690", "ja": "え？　ええと……。", "zh": "咦？呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_2003_039kon", "source_sha256": "c83d66b5f730bab50dd171e55364f630be3542034e3557465a77c7e24076be50", "ja": "とにかく……コホン。\nこれからも、期待しててちょうだい！", "zh": "总之……咳咳。\n今后也请继续期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_2004_039kon", "source_sha256": "56f2982d8a22f444cfaf048bbbb10798f51e85dadaaacad56850dd85ca21d24a", "ja": "こんなに素敵な衣装があれば、きっとどんな冒険も\n乗り越えられるはずだわ。", "zh": "有这么棒的服装在身边，一定无论怎样的冒险都能克服的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0374_2005_039kon", "source_sha256": "6b621b792ed5f363e518638dab0551c5c4919f42db5f5b5bc48058091017bff7", "ja": "そしていつか、トップアイドルっていうゴールに\n辿り着けたら……一緒に、最高の景色を見ましょうね！", "zh": "总有一天，如果能抵达“顶尖偶像”这个终点……我们一起去看看最棒的风景吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
